#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand the Qiskit addon tools, which help you build utility-grade "
"quantum workflows."
msgstr ""
"Comprende las herramientas de complementos de Qiskit, que te ayudan a "
"construir flujos de trabajo cuánticos a nivel de utilidad."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced techniques - Qiskit addons"
msgstr "Técnicas avanzadas - Complementos de Qiskit (addons)"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore lightcones */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore lightcones */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Advanced techniques - Qiskit addons {#advanced-techniques-qiskit-addons}"
msgstr ""
"Técnicas avanzadas - Complementos de Qiskit (addons) {#advanced-techniques-"
"qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit addons are a collection of research capabilities for enabling "
"algorithm discovery at the utility scale. These modular software components "
"build on Qiskit’s performant foundation and can plug into a "
"[workflow](/guides/intro-to-patterns) to scale or design new quantum "
"algorithms. This page highlights the available tools across key functional "
"categories to help you choose relevant capabilities when building your "
"workflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Los complementos de Qiskit (addons) son una colección de capacidades de "
"investigación para permitir el descubrimiento de algoritmos a escala de "
"utilidad. Estos componentes modulares de software se basan en la base de "
"alto rendimiento de Qiskit y pueden integrarse en un [flujo de trabajo "
"(workflow)](/guides/intro-to-patterns) para escalar o diseñar nuevos "
"algoritmos cuánticos. Esta página destaca las herramientas disponibles en "
"categorías funcionales clave para ayudarte a elegir las capacidades "
"relevantes al construir tus flujos de trabajo.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Map domain problems {#map-domain-problems}"
msgstr "Mapear problemas del dominio {#map-domain-problems}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These capabilities specialize in mapping domain problems into quantum operators and circuits for execution on a quantum computer.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"Model optimization problems and map them into representations that can be understood by a quantum computer.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Estas capacidades se especializan en mapear problemas del dominio en operadores y circuitos cuánticos para su ejecución en una computadora cuántica.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Optimizador de mapeo\"\n"
"      description=\"Modela problemas de optimización y mapéalos en representaciones que una computadora cuántica pueda entender.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Optimization mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      description=\"Model fermionic quantum systems and map them to qubit operators and circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-fermions/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Mapeador fermiónico\"\n"
"      description=\"Modela sistemas cuánticos fermiónicos y mapéalos en operadores de qubit y circuitos.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-fermions/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Fermionic mapper\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      description=\"Construct high-fidelity circuits with reduced depth using approximate quantum compilation with tensor networks.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      description=\"Construye circuitos de alta fidelidad con profundidad reducida usando compilación cuántica aproximada con redes tensoriales.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: AQC-Tensor\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Multi-product formulas\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce the Trotter error of Hamiltonian dynamics through a weighted combination of several circuit executions.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mpf/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: MPF\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Fórmulas multiproducto\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce el error de Trotter de la dinámica Hamiltoniana mediante una combinación ponderada de varias ejecuciones del circuito.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mpf/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: MPF\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr "</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optimize circuits for hardware execution {#optimize-circuits-for-hardware-"
"execution}"
msgstr ""
"Optimizar circuitos para ejecución en hardware {#optimize-circuits-for-"
"hardware-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These capabilities are useful for reducing circuit depth and typically come with an increased sampling overhead.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Operator backpropagation\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce circuit depth in expectation value estimations by backpropagating observables through the circuit.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-obp/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: OBP\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Estas capacidades son útiles para reducir la profundidad del circuito y suelen conllevar una mayor sobrecarga de muestreo.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Retropropagación de operadores\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce la profundidad del circuito en estimaciones de valores esperados retropropagando los observables a través del circuito.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-obp/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: OBP\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce the depth of transpiled circuits by decomposing entangling gates between non-adjacent qubits.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-cutting\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Corte de circuitos\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce la profundidad de los circuitos transpilados descomponiendo las puertas entrelazadas entre qubits no adyacentes.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-cutting\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: Circuit cutting\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Manage noise for expectation value estimation {#manage-noise-for-"
"expectation-value-estimation}"
msgstr ""
"Gestionar el ruido para la estimación de valores esperados {#manage-noise-"
"for-expectation-value-estimation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the following addons to manage noise when building quantum workloads "
"that estimate expectation values of observables.\n"
msgstr ""
"Usa los siguientes complementos para gestionar el ruido al construir cargas "
"de trabajo cuánticas que estiman valores esperados de observables.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Propagated noise absorption\"\n"
"      description=\"Mitigate expectation values by measuring a target observable that has absorbed noise model information.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PNA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Shaded lightcones\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) sampling overhead by removing noise model terms that have low impact on the observable estimation.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SLC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Absorción de ruido propagado\"\n"
"      description=\"Mitiga valores esperados midiendo un observable objetivo que ha absorbido la información del modelo de ruido.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: PNA\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Conos de luz sombreados\"\n"
"      description=\"Reduce la sobrecarga de muestreo de la cancelación probabilística de errores (PEC) eliminando los términos del modelo de ruido que tienen poco impacto en la estimación del observable.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SLC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage noise for sampling results {#manage-noise-for-sampling-results}"
msgstr ""
"Gestionar el ruido para resultados de muestreo {#manage-noise-for-sampling-"
"results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "These techniques are useful for managing noise on sampling results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Estas técnicas son útiles para gestionar el ruido en los resultados de "
"muestreo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<CardGroup>\n"
msgstr "<CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization\"\n"
"      description=\"Estimate the spectrum of quantum Hamiltonians by processing noisy samples and diagonalizing in a reduced subspace.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/qiskit-addons-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Overview\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Diagonalización cuántica basada en muestras\"\n"
"      description=\"Estima el espectro de Hamiltonianos cuánticos procesando muestras con ruido y diagonalizando en un subespacio reducido.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/qiskit-addons-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Overview\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      description=\"An HPC-ready implementation of the SQD addon, written in modern C++17 standards and designed to enable HPC workflows and applications.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd-hpc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"SQD para HPC\"\n"
"      description=\"Una implementación de SQD lista para HPC, escrita en los estándares modernos C++17 y diseñada para habilitar flujos de trabajo y aplicaciones HPC.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd-hpc/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: SQD for HPC\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Measurement-based postselection\"\n"
"      description=\"Filter out non-Markovian noise in circuits by incorporating measurement-based postselection transpiler passes.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/apidocs/qiskit_addon_utils.noise_management.post_selection.transpiler.passes.html\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page for post-selection\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Read the API reference\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Postselección basada en mediciones\"\n"
"      description=\"Filtra el ruido no markoviano en los circuitos incorporando pases de transpilación de postselección basados en mediciones.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/apidocs/qiskit_addon_utils.noise_management.post_selection.transpiler.passes.html\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page for post-selection\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Read the API reference\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Matrix-free Measurement Mitigation (M3)\"\n"
"      description=\"Mitigate measurement errors by processing in a reduced subspace defined by noisy bitstrings.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mthree/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: M3\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Mitigación de mediciones sin matrices (M3)\"\n"
"      description=\"Mitiga errores de medición procesando en un subespacio reducido definido por cadenas de bits con ruido.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-mthree/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: M3\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Supporting capabilities {#supporting-capabilities}"
msgstr "Capacidades de soporte {#supporting-capabilities}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use these capabilities to support and compose your workflows that leverage other addons.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Addon utilities\"\n"
"      description=\"Build addons-powered workflows faster by using this collection of functions for creating Hamiltonians, generating Trotter time-evolution circuits, and applying the latest error mitigation capabilities.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: addon utilities\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"Usa estas capacidades para dar soporte y componer tus flujos de trabajo que aprovechan otros complementos.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
"  <Card\n"
"      title=\"Utilidades para complementos\"\n"
"      description=\"Construye flujos de trabajo con complementos más rápido usando esta colección de funciones para crear Hamiltonianos, generar circuitos de evolución temporal de Trotter y aplicar las últimas capacidades de mitigación de errores.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: addon utilities\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Pauli propagation\"\n"
"      description=\"A framework to approximate operator evolution, which can be used to simulate expectation values and implement error mitigation techniques, such as propagated noise absorption (PNA) and shaded lightcones.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/pauli-prop/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: pauli propagation\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Propagación de Pauli\"\n"
"      description=\"Un marco para aproximar la evolución de operadores, que puede usarse para simular valores esperados e implementar técnicas de mitigación de errores, como la absorción de ruido propagado (PNA) y los conos de luz sombreados.\"\n"
"      href=\"https://qiskit.github.io/pauli-prop/\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Documentation page: pauli propagation\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
